{
  "id": "E111",
  "title": "Don’t Drive Too Fast",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-05-06",
  "synopsis": "Learn some basic sentences for taking a cab. You will also find talking to cabdrivers is a good way of improving you Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/412/5eb7223cbefa6b3019f9bf6f9651e5433556706f.mp3?1493653340",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "别开太快\n\n乘客：师傅，麻烦你开一下后备箱，我有个大行李箱。\n司机：好，开了。\n乘客：谢谢。我要去机场。\n司机：好的。\n乘客：师傅，不要开太快，我害怕……\n司机：你不用赶飞机？\n乘客：我的飞机12点起飞。还有很多时间，不着急。\n司机：好的，那我慢一点。\n乘客：谢谢你。",
    "traditional": "別開太快\n\n乘客：師傅，麻煩你開一下後備箱，我有個大行李箱。\n司機：好，開了。\n乘客：謝謝。我要去機場。\n司機：好的。\n乘客：師傅，不要開太快，我害怕……\n司機：你不用趕飛機？\n乘客：我的飛機12點起飛。還有很多時間，不著急。\n司機：好的，那我慢一點。\n乘客：謝謝你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don’t drive too fast"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "乘客：师傅，麻烦你开一下后备箱，我有个大行李箱。",
      "traditional": "乘客：師傅，麻煩你開一下後備箱，我有個大行李箱。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè shī fu má fan nǐ kāi yí xià hòu bèi xiāng wǒ yǒu ge dà xíng li xiāng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Driver, could you please open the trunk? I have a big suitcase."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "司机：好，开了。",
      "traditional": "司機：好，開了。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo kāi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drive: Ok, it’s open."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "乘客：谢谢。我要去机场。",
      "traditional": "乘客：謝謝。我要去機場。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè xiè xie wǒ yào qù jī chǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Thanks. I want to go to the airport."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "司机：好的。",
      "traditional": "司機：好的。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drive: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "乘客：师傅，不要开太快，我害怕……",
      "traditional": "乘客：師傅，不要開太快，我害怕……",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè shī fu bú yào kāi tài kuài wǒ hài pà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Driver, don’t drive too fast, I’m scared."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "司机：你不用赶飞机？",
      "traditional": "司機：你不用趕飛機？",
      "pinyin": "sī jī nǐ bú yòng gǎn fēi jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drive: Don’t you need to catch a flight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "乘客：我的飞机12点起飞。还有很多时间，不着急。",
      "traditional": "乘客：我的飛機12點起飛。還有很多時間，不著急。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè wǒ de fēi jī 2 diǎn qǐ fēi hái yǒu hěn duō shí jiān bù zháo jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: My flight will take off at 12 o’clock. We still have a lot of time. There is no rush."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "司机：好的，那我慢一点。",
      "traditional": "司機：好的，那我慢一點。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo de nà wǒ màn yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drive: Ok, I will slow down a bit."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "乘客：谢谢你。",
      "traditional": "乘客：謝謝你。",
      "pinyin": "chéng kè xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Passenger: Thank you!"
    }
  ],
